  "releaseNotes": "- Improved text measurement accuracy by migrating from Graphics.MeasureString (GDI+) to TextRenderer.MeasureText (GDI)\n            - Removed Graphics dependency for better testability\n            - Text sizing now matches actual TextBox rendering more accurately",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
